Read `AGENTS.md` before acting.
The primary broker dispatches through Multplx and never through Cursor subagents, background agents, or Cursor-owned worktrees.
Keep Cursor sandboxing enabled; never use `--force`, `--yolo`, or `--sandbox disabled` for routine work.
Run `bin/mx-session-start.sh` exactly once at session start when instructed by the tracked session hook.
